    <LocalizedTextData><![CDATA[<LocalizedText><Text id="LOC_TSOD_CECIL_EMPIRE_MOD_TITLE"><en_US>[The Sword of Dawn (TSOD)] Cecil Empire Civilization</en_US><zh_Hans_CN>《黎明之剑》塞西尔帝国文明</zh_Hans_CN></Text><Text id="LOC_TSOD_CECIL_EMPIRE_MOD_TEASER"><en_US>New Civilization and Leaders - Cecil Empire lead by Gawain Cecil, from the web novel The Sword of Dawn.</en_US><zh_Hans_CN>新文明和领袖——高文·塞西尔领导的塞西尔帝国文明</zh_Hans_CN></Text><Text id="LOC_TSOD_CECIL_EMPIRE_MOD_DESCRIPTION"><en_US>This MOD adds the civilization Cecil Empire from the online novel "The Sword of Dawn", including the leader, Gawain Cecil, and his team.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Requires the Gathering Storm ruleset, Rise and Fall, the Vietnam and Kublai Khan Pack and the Ethiopia Pack DLC.</en_US><zh_Hans_CN>此模组添加了来自网络小说《黎明之剑》的文明“塞西尔帝国”，包括领袖高文·塞西尔及其团队。[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]需要《风云变幻》规则集、《迭起兴衰》、《越南和忽必烈包》以及《埃塞俄比亚包》。</zh_Hans_CN></Text></LocalizedText>]]></LocalizedTextData>
    <AssemblyName>TSODCecilEmpire</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>TSODCecilEmpire</RootNamespace>
    <Authors>Brus Gwyn Fuchkyo</Authors>
